---
// HowItWorks.astro
---

<section id="como-funciona" class="py-24 bg-white relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-[#2C4A5E]">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#7FBDA3]"></span>
        <span>EXPERIENCIA FLUÍDA</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#2C4A5E] tracking-tight">
        Control total en <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#6BA5C8] to-[#7FBDA3]">tres simples pasos</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#4A5568]">
        Sin instalaciones, sin descargas pesadas en la App Store y sin contraseñas que olvidar.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Step Process Grid -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative">
      
      <!-- Connecting line for desktop -->
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-1/3 left-1/6 right-1/6 h-0.5 border-t-2 border-dashed border-[#6BA5C8]/30 -z-0"></div>

      <!-- STEP 1 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-100 relative z-10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform group">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#6BA5C8] to-[#4A8EB8] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-2xl mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-[#6BA5C8]/25 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          01
        </div>
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#6BA5C8]/10 text-[#6BA5C8] text-xs font-bold mb-3">
          1 toque y listo
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-[#2C4A5E] mb-3">Abre el Chat en WhatsApp</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A5568] leading-relaxed">
          Toca en "Chatear con SmartSavings" y envía tu primer mensaje. Tu perfil financiero se crea en PostgreSQL (Supabase) al instante usando tu número de teléfono.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- STEP 2 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-100 relative z-10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform group">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#7FBDA3] to-[#5AA688] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-2xl mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/25 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          02
        </div>
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#7FBDA3]/15 text-[#2C4A5E] text-xs font-bold mb-3">
          Multimodal con IA
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-[#2C4A5E] mb-3">Registra en 2 Segundos</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A5568] leading-relaxed">
          Habla, escribe o envía fotos de tus facturas. Whisper transcribe tus audios, DeepSeek clasifica gastos e ingresos y Gemini 2.5 Flash lee los recibos de compra.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- STEP 3 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-100 relative z-10 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform group">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#D4A574] to-[#B88752] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-2xl mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/25 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          03
        </div>
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#D4A574]/15 text-[#8F5E28] text-xs font-bold mb-3">
          Tranquilidad total
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-[#2C4A5E] mb-3">Detén la Fuga Quincenal</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A5568] leading-relaxed">
          Recibe cierres automáticos a las 2 PM y 8 PM para que no olvides nada, y resúmenes con gráficos a las 9 PM con tu saldo protegido para llegar sobrado de dinero.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
